{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wA1pySBW811792826595.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>新皇崗口岸啟用近兩周，入境處新增合作查驗「e-道」登記站，方便市民登記。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-1500_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026N6Voo6DNK31792826636.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>新增登記站位於5樓離境層，尚未用「香港E道」手機應用程式登記的市民，可帶同7至17歲子女即場辦理。入境處處長郭俊峯等到口岸視察運作情況。入境處指，會繼續監察客流和車流，優化細節。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:22:11.179271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T18:58:09.589326+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:18:14.076276+00:00","content_hash":"2d5364438c1f1439a2f10784ccb2e9d923f07a63685f570e2e910d62dafedad9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}